          "why": "Liquity v2 BOLD's inverted-money-market spread framing and yBOLD's auto-compounding wrapper attracted readers modeling real net yield versus borrow costs — a signals-over-narrative cohort."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Regulatory carve-outs and compliance lines",
          "why": "The Danish FSA decentralization exemption test, Capitol Hill DeFi hearing, and US Treasury reporting delay all clicked because readers are tracking which jurisdiction is building a legal on-ramp versus closing the door."
