        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "DeFi 1.0 contrarian revival thesis",
          "why": "The undervalued DeFi 1.0 tokens piece and MakerDAO's DeFi summer ambition tapped a contrarian segment hunting for battle-tested protocols generating real revenue but mispriced relative to newer narratives."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Oracle MEV and price-feed infrastructure",
          "why": "Uma Oval's oracle extractable value capture and BAMM's explicit oracle-free lending design both drew readers who understand that price-feed dependency is the hidden rent layer most protocols leave on the table."
        }
